    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 295,000\n\n\nFabulous retirement, family or holiday home coming to the market in pristine condition throughout. \n\nWestwinds is a small well-managed landmark estate situated in the pretty village of Kilrane with its pubs and excellent primary school. Rosslare Harbour is minute drive away and Wexford town centre is within 10 km with a bus service also available in the village. \n\nThis neat three bedroom bungalow comes with the benefit of a maintenance free back garden and has plenty of room to expand to the rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.94m x 1.36m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.7m x 1.33m\n\n\nHall - 2.75m x 1m\n\n\nHotpress - \n\n\nLiving Room - 5.34m x 4.04m\nComfortable room with dual aspect, Bay Window, open fireplace and double doors assessing the kitchen.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.53m x 3.28m\nGood size with Velux, waist and eye level storage and double doors to the rear patio and maintenance free garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.31m x 2.45m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.28m x 2.91m\n\n\nBedroom 3 Ensuite - 4.8m x 4m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - 1.95m x 1m\nWith part tiled walls, Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBathroom - 3.75m x 2.12m\nWith bath, w.c. w.h.b and part tiled walls and splashbacks.\n\n"
      },
